WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:04.150
It's hard to believe, but it's been it's been
15 years since The Ring was released.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.580
And in that time, this girl…

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.360
...somehow turned into this girl.

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.639
Would you believe the actress who starred
as the waterlogged ghost gal is actually a

00:00:15.639 --> 00:00:16.950
normal person in real life?

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:21.760
Here's what Daveigh Chase has been doing since
she first scared the pants off of us.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:22.900
Young breakout

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:28.400
Take away all the makeup and CG corpse effects,
and Chase was — big surprise — a normal

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.400
kid.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.750
Well, a normal kid with a growing Hollywood
career.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:35.540
The year before The Ring was released, Chase
voiced the lead in the English dub of Spirited

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:39.680
Away and co-starred in Donnie Darko as Donnie's
younger sister, Samantha.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:44.750
In 2002, in addition to starring in The Ring,
but she also voiced Lilo in Lilo &amp; Stitch.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:48.450
She reprised her role for two Lilo &amp; Stitch
video games, as well as the Lilo &amp; Stitch

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:52.260
cartoon series, from 2003 to 2006.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.739
Other roles

00:00:53.739 --> 00:00:58.180
Chase had a memorable arc as the troublemaking
teen bride Rhonda Volmer on the HBO show Big

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.510
Love from 2006 to 2011.

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:06.720
She's also appeared on TV shows like CSI,
ER, Charmed, Cold Case, and Without A Trace,

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:10.890
and reprised her role from Donnie Darko in
the 2009 sequel, S. Darko.

00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:14.930
Her most recent projects have been independent
films, including American Romance and Jack

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:15.990
Goes Home.

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:17.430
L.A. life

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:22.041
Though she grew up in Albany, Oregon, Chase's
Instagram feed could easily double as a tourism

00:01:22.041 --> 00:01:24.840
guide for Los Angeles, where she currently
lives.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:27.770
Her views of the skyline alone could be used
for a brochure.

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:32.159
The bulk of Chase's Instagram account is dedicated
to all the time she spends with animals, but

00:01:32.159 --> 00:01:36.480
she still has a sense of humor about having
once been a young horror icon, as evidenced

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:41.210
by one Instagram post asking, "Should I be
a slutty Samara for Halloween?"

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:42.400
Hospital drop off

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:47.030
On Feb. 15, 2017, Chase's real life became
a scene from a movie.

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:51.590
TMZ reported that Chase rushed a dying man
to a hospital in Los Angeles, left him outside,

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:52.870
then left the scene.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:55.470
The site reported that Chase may have been
hanging out with him that day.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:59.509
When police ran Chase's name, they discovered
an outstanding warrant for her arrest in an

00:01:59.509 --> 00:02:00.979
unrelated case.

00:02:00.979 --> 00:02:04.810
According to the New York Daily News, Chase
is "not a suspect in the death and authorities

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:08.530
have reason to believe the man overdosed and
the actress was just trying to get him to

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:09.560
the hospital."

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:10.780
Arrest warrant

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:15.450
Leaving a dying man outside a hospital is
an unusual move, but it's possible that Chase

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:19.342
didn't want to draw any attention to herself,
seeing as she had a warrant out for her arrest

00:02:19.342 --> 00:02:20.342
at the time.

00:02:20.342 --> 00:02:24.810
Fox News reported that Chase was arrested
on February 22, 2017 for a traffic-related

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:25.819
violation.

00:02:25.819 --> 00:02:29.580
According to Fox News, she was also questioned
about the unidentified man's fatal overdose,

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:35.040
but at the time of this video, she does not
face any charges in connection with that death.

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:36.060
On the road

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:40.760
While Chase had several filming projects in
2016, her schedule for 2017 looks totally

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.760
open.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.020
From the looks of her Instagram, she's been
spending time out on the road in an RV and

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:48.150
generally staying pretty far from the bright
lights of Hollywood.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:51.379
Whether the former child star is finished
with acting for good or just taking a break

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:55.300
for awhile, we can always go back and spend
some quality time with Samara Morgan.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:04.280
Thanks for watching!

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:06.320
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:08.870
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

